  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFRIpads 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFRIpads was established with a clear goal: to overcome key challenges that women and girls in Africa face whilst on their period in relation to access, affordability and sustainability of quality menstrual products.
With TA support AFRIpads wants to increase the accessibility to affordable, quality menstrual products for women and girls in Africa. This combined with the company&#x2019;s desire to further boost local production, employment and skilling on the one hand, and to extend their business from selling only reusable pads to NGOs to selling reusable and disposable pads to both NGOs and on the consumer market, on the other hand.</narrative>
  </description>
